    <div class="entry-content" set:html={`<p>넓은 콩 대 신장 콩. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_0" data-source="" data-orig="They are common legumes in our daily lives">They are common legumes in our daily lives</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_1" data-source="" data-orig="The major suppliers of these beans worldwide are mainly located in countries such as Australia">The major suppliers of these beans worldwide are mainly located in countries such as Australia</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_2" data-source="" data-orig="France">France</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_3" data-source="" data-orig="the UK">the UK</span>, 에티오피아, 캐나다, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_4" data-source="" data-orig="Mexico">Mexico</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_5" data-source="" data-orig="and Argentina">and Argentina</span>. 중국에서, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_6" data-source="" data-orig="regions like Jiangsu">regions like Jiangsu</span>, 안후이, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_7" data-source="" data-orig="and Hubei provide a stable supply of broad beans">and Hubei provide a stable supply of broad beans</span>. 또한, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_8" data-source="" data-orig="areas with higher altitudes">areas with higher altitudes</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_9" data-source="" data-orig="such as Gansu and Qinghai">such as Gansu and Qinghai</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_10" data-source="" data-orig="are also major producers of broad beans">are also major producers of broad beans</span>. 반면에, 헤베이, 산시성, 내몽고, Jilin, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_11" data-source="" data-orig="and Heilongjiang are the main regions for kidney bean production">and Heilongjiang are the main regions for kidney bean production</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_12" data-source="" data-orig="Notably">Notably</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_13" data-source="" data-orig="China is the world&#8217;s third-largest producer of kidney beans">China is the world&#8217;s third-largest producer of kidney beans</span>.</p><p><img src="/images/1728894637310-300x199.jpg" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-480" alt="Broad beans vs kidney beans" width="525" height="348" title="넓은 콩 대 신장 콩 | 가장 유용한 지식 4" /></p><div id="ez-toc-container" class="ez-toc-v2_0_85 counter-hierarchy ez-toc-counter ez-toc-grey ez-toc-container-direction"><div class="ez-toc-title-container"><p class="ez-toc-title" style="cursor:inherit">목차</p>
