ata-source="" data-orig="What are the planting methods for broad beans and kidney beans">What are the planting methods for broad beans and kidney beans</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_62" data-source="" data-orig="After understanding their production areas">After understanding their production areas</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_63" data-source="" data-orig="let&#8217;s learn about their planting methods">let&#8217;s learn about their planting methods</span>.</p><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Broad_Beans"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_64" data-source="" data-orig="Broad Beans">Broad Beans</span>:</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_65" data-source="" data-orig="Soil Selection">Soil Selection</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_66" data-source="" data-orig="Choose loose">Choose loose</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_67" data-source="" data-orig="fertile">fertile</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_68" data-source="" data-orig="and well-drained soil">and well-drained soil</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_69" data-source="" data-orig="Seed Treatment">Seed Treatment</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_70" data-source="" data-orig="Soak the seeds for">Soak the seeds for</span> 12 에게 24 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_71" data-source="" data-orig="hours before sowing to improve germination rates">hours before sowing to improve germination rates</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_72" data-source="" data-orig="Sowing Method">Sowing Method</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_73" data-source="" data-orig="Direct sowing or transplanting">Direct sowing or transplanting</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_74" data-source="" data-orig="Direct sowing involves scattering seeds directly in the field">Direct sowing involves scattering seeds directly in the field</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_75" data-source="" data-orig="while transplanting involves growing seedlings in nursery boxes and then transplanting them into the field">while transplanting involves growing seedlings in nursery boxes and then transplanting them into the field</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_76" data-source="" data-orig="Management Practices">Management Practices</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_77" data-source="" data-orig="Keep the soil moist">Keep the soil moist</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_78" data-source="" data-orig="weed in time">weed in time</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_79" data-source="" data-orig="apply sufficient base fertilizer">apply sufficient base fertilizer</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_80" data-source="" data-orig="provide timely top-dressing">provide timely top-dressing</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_81" data-source="" data-orig="and control pests and diseases">and control pests and diseases</span>.</li></ul><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Kidney_Beans"></span><strong>강낭콩:</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_82" data-source="" data-orig="Soil Selection">Soil Selection</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_83" data-source="" data-orig="Fertile soil with good aeration and deep soil layers">Fertile soil with good aeration and deep soil layers</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_84" data-source="" data-orig="with convenient irrigation and drainage">with convenient irrigation and drainage</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_85" data-source="" data-orig="Seed Treatment">Seed Treatment</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_86" data-source="" data-orig="Select large">Select large</span>, 쿵, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_87" data-source="" data-orig="uniform seeds with consistent luster">uniform seeds with consistent luster</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_88" data-source="" data-orig="free of pests and damage">free of pests and damage</span>. <span class ="tr_" id