g="and control pests and diseases">and control pests and diseases</span>.</li></ul><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_are_their_respective_yields"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_105" data-source="" data-orig="What are their respective yields">What are their respective yields</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_106" data-source="" data-orig="Broad Beans">Broad Beans</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_107" data-source="" data-orig="Under normal planting conditions">Under normal planting conditions</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_108" data-source="" data-orig="the yield of fresh broad beans is generally around">the yield of fresh broad beans is generally around</span> 150 에게 200 MU 당 kg (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_109" data-source="" data-orig="approximately">approximately</span> 0.067 헥타르), <span class ="tr_" id="tr_110" data-source="" data-orig="with high-yield instances reaching up to">with high-yield instances reaching up to</span> 280 MU 당 kg. 예를 들어, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_111" data-source="" data-orig="in Qujing City">in Qujing City</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_112" data-source="" data-orig="high-yield demonstration plots can average between">high-yield demonstration plots can average between</span> 250 그리고 290 MU 당 kg.</li><li><strong>강낭콩:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_113" data-source="" data-orig="When grown in sunny">When grown in sunny</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_114" data-source="" data-orig="warm environments">warm environments</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_115" data-source="" data-orig="the yield can reach approximately">the yield can reach approximately</span> 2,650 MU 당 kg. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_116" data-source="" data-orig="In Zhi Jin County’s high-yield demonstration base">In Zhi Jin County’s high-yield demonstration base</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_117" data-source="" data-orig="the average yield ranges from">the average yield ranges from</span> 133.42 에게 148.65 MU 당 kg, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_118" data-source="" data-orig="with the highest recorded yield at">with the highest recorded yield at</span> 163.97 kg.</li></ul><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Which_is_more_nutritious"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_119" data-source="" data-orig="Which is more nutritious">Which is more nutritious</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_120" data-source="" data-orig="To determine which bean is more nutritious">To determine which bean is more nutritious</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_121" data-source="" data-orig="let’s look at their specific nutritional components">let’s look at their specific nutritional components</span>.</p><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Broad_Beans-2"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_122" data-source="" data-orig="Broad Beans">Broad Beans</span>:</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul><li><strong>비타민:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_123" data-source="" data-orig="Rich in various vitamins">Rich in various vitamins</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_124" data-source="" data-orig="including vitamins A">including vitamins A</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_125" data-source="" data-orig="K">K</span>, 기음, 이자형, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_126" data-source="" data-orig="B1">B1</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_127" data-source="" data-orig="thiamine">thiamine</span>), 지하 2층 (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_128" data-source="" data-orig="riboflavin">riboflavin</span>), <span class ="tr_" id="tr_129" data-source="" data-orig="and niacin">and niacin</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_130" data-source="" data-orig="The vitamin C content is particularly high">The vitamin C content is particularly high</span>, 약 16 에게 30 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_131" data-source="" data-orig="mg per">mg per</span> 100 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_132" data-source="" data-orig="grams of broad beans">grams of broad beans</span>.</li><li><strong>탄산수