7" data-source="" data-orig="especially B vitamins and vitamin C">especially B vitamins and vitamin C</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_148" data-source="" data-orig="which is about">which is about</span> 9 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_149" data-source="" data-orig="mg per">mg per</span> 100 그램. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_150" data-source="" data-orig="It also contains vitamins A">It also contains vitamins A</span>, 이자형, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_151" data-source="" data-orig="B1">B1</span>, 지하 2층, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_152" data-source="" data-orig="and niacin">and niacin</span>.</li><li><strong>탄산수:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_153" data-source="" data-orig="Contains significant amounts of minerals">Contains significant amounts of minerals</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_154" data-source="" data-orig="particularly calcium">particularly calcium</span>, 철, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_155" data-source="" data-orig="and phosphorus">and phosphorus</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_156" data-source="" data-orig="Calcium content ranges from">Calcium content ranges from</span> 88 에게 349 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_157" data-source="" data-orig="mg per">mg per</span> 100 그램, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_158" data-source="" data-orig="phosphorus from">phosphorus from</span> 37 에게 400 Mg, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_159" data-source="" data-orig="and iron from">and iron from</span> 1 에게 2.8 Mg. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_160" data-source="" data-orig="Also contains zinc and magnesium">Also contains zinc and magnesium</span>.</li><li><strong>지방:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_161" data-source="" data-orig="Low fat content">Low fat content</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_162" data-source="" data-orig="approximately">approximately</span> 0.56 에게 1.4 그램 당 100 그램.</li><li><strong>식이섬유:</strong> 식이섬유 함량이 높아, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_163" data-source="" data-orig="promoting gastrointestinal health">promoting gastrointestinal health</span>, 약 7.4 그램 당 100 그램.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_164" data-source="" data-orig="Sugars">Sugars</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_165" data-source="" data-orig="Moderate sugar content">Moderate sugar content</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_166" data-source="" data-orig="primarily in carbohydrate form">primarily in carbohydrate form</span>, 약 22 에게 57.4 그램 당 100 그램, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_167" data-source="" data-orig="with lower sugar levels of about">with lower sugar levels of about</span> 0.3 에게 6.4 그램 (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_168" data-source="" data-orig="depending on variety and ripeness">depending on variety and ripeness</span>).</li></ul><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_169" data-source="" data-orig="Both beans have distinct nutritional advantages">Both beans have distinct nutritional advantages</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_170" data-source="" data-orig="making it difficult to declare one as definitively better than the other">making it difficult to declare one as definitively better than the other</span>; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_171" data-source="" data-orig="it largely depends on individual dietary needs">it largely depends on individual dietary needs</span>.</p><p>예를 들어, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_172" data-source="" data-orig="kidney beans are known for aiding digestion">kidney beans are known for aiding digestion</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_173" data-source="" data-orig="weight loss">weight loss</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_174" data-source="" data-orig="blood enrichment">blood enrichment</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_175" data-source="" data-orig="spleen health">spleen health</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_176" data-source="" data-orig="lowering blood sugar">lowering blood sugar</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_177" data-source="" data-orig="and protecting blood vessels">and protecting blood vessels</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_178" data-source="" data-orig="Broad beans benefit brain and nerve health">Broad beans benefit brain and nerve health</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_179" data-source="" data-orig="enhancing memory and cognitive function">enhancing memory and cognitive function</span>. 또한, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_180" data-source="" data-orig="broad beans are low in calories">broad beans are low in calories</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_181" data-source="" data-orig="and suitable for individuals with high cholesterol or hypertension">and suitable for individuals with high cholesterol or hypertension</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_182" data-source="" data-orig="They also have effects on energy boosting">They also have effects on energy boosting</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_183" data-source="" data-orig="spleen health">spleen health</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_184" data-source="" data-orig="and reducing edema">and reducing edema</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_185" data-source="" data-orig="Ultimately">Ultimately</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_186" data-source="" data-orig="the choice between kidney beans and broad beans can be based on personal nutritional needs and health conditions">the choice between kidney beans and broad beans can be based on personal nutritional needs and health conditions</span>.</p><p><img src="/images/1728894762751-300x237.jpg" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-481" alt="Broad beans vs kidney beans" width="681" height="538" title="넓은 콩 대 신장 콩 | 가장 유용한 지식 5" /></p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_are_the_varieties_of_kidney_beans"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_187" data-source="" data-orig="What are the varieties of kidney beans">What are the varieties of kidney beans</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_188" data-source="" data-orig="Kidney beans come in many varieties">Kidney beans come in many varieties</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_189" data-source="" data-orig="Here are some of the notable types">Here are some of the notable types</span>:</p><table style="border-