source="" data-orig="In northern China">In northern China</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_252" data-source="" data-orig="kidney beans are more commonly used in hearty dishes">kidney beans are more commonly used in hearty dishes</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_253" data-source="" data-orig="reflecting the northern preference for robust flavors">reflecting the northern preference for robust flavors</span>.</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;">강낭콩</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;">인도</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_254" data-source="" data-orig="Kidney beans are a primary ingredient in dishes like Dal Makhani">Kidney beans are a primary ingredient in dishes like Dal Makhani</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_255" data-source="" data-orig="buttery lentils">buttery lentils</span>), <span class ="tr_" id="tr_256" data-source="" data-orig="which are made with black lentils and red kidney beans cooked with cream or yogurt">which are made with black lentils and red kidney beans cooked with cream or yogurt</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_257" data-source="" data-orig="making it a popular North Indian dish">making it a popular North Indian dish</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_258" data-source="" data-orig="Rajma">Rajma</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_259" data-source="" data-orig="a stew made with red kidney beans and various spices">a stew made with red kidney beans and various spices</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_260" data-source="" data-orig="is often served during celebrations and special occasions">is often served during celebrations and special occasions</span>.</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;">강낭콩</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_261" data-source="" data-orig="Italy">Italy</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_262" data-source="" data-orig="White kidney beans are often the main ingredient in hearty vegetable soups">White kidney beans are often the main ingredient in hearty vegetable soups</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_263" data-source="" data-orig="simmered with salted pork and cheese for a rich and aromatic broth">simmered with salted pork and cheese for a rich and aromatic broth</span>.</td></tr></tbody></table><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_to_Choose_the_Best_Fava_Beans_and_Kidney_Beans"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_264" data-source="" data-orig="How to Choose the Best Fava Beans and Kidney Beans">How to Choose the Best Fava Beans and Kidney Beans</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_265" data-source="" data-orig="Having gained a comprehensive understanding of fava beans and kidney beans">Having gained a comprehensive understanding of fava beans and kidney beans</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_266" data-source="" data-orig="I would like to share how we should select the best fava beans and kidney beans">I would like to share how we should select the best fava beans and kidney beans</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_267" data-source="" data-orig="We can choose based on their color">We can choose based on their color</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_268" data-source="" data-orig="shape">shape</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_269" data-source="" data-orig="and texture">and texture</span>.</p><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Fava_Beans"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_270" data-source="" data-orig="Fava Beans">Fava Beans</span>:</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul><li><strong>색상:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_271" data-source="" data-orig="Fava beans should be a bright green color">Fava beans should be a bright green color</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_272" data-source="" data-orig="with the brighter">with the brighter</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_273" data-source="" data-orig="the better">the better</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_274" data-source="" data-orig="If the fava beans come with pods">If the fava beans come with pods</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_275" data-source="" data-orig="the pod skin and the sides should also be green">the pod skin and the sides should also be green</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_276" data-source="" data-orig="At the same time">At the same time</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_277" data-source="" data-orig="avoid purchasing artificially dyed fava beans">avoid purchasing artificially dyed fava beans</span>; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_278" data-source="" data-orig="you can blow gently on the fava beans and lightly squeeze them to see if the color comes off">you can blow gently on the fava beans and lightly squeeze them to see if the color comes off</span>.</li><li><strong>모양:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_279" data-source="" data-orig="Fava beans should be flat and round">Fava beans should be flat and round</span>; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_280" data-source="" data-orig="choose full and round fava beans">choose full and round fava beans</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_281" data-source="" data-orig="as these are fresher and have better taste">as these are fresher and have better taste</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_282" data-source="" data-orig="Avoid selecting shriveled or incomplete fava beans">Avoid selecting shriveled or incomplete fava beans</span>.</li><li><strong>조직:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_283" data-source="" data-orig="Good fava beans should be hard and not easily squished">Good fava beans should be hard and not easily squished</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_284" data-source="" data-orig="If the fava beans feel soft when squeezed">If the fava beans feel soft when squeezed</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_285" data-source="" data-orig="it indicates they are no longer fresh or of poor quality">it indicates they are no longer fresh or of poor quality</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_286" data-source="" data-orig="which will negatively affect their taste">which will negatively affect their taste</span>.</li></ul><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Kidney_Beans-3"></span><strong>강낭콩:</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul><li><strong>색상:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_287" data-source="" data-orig="High-quality kidney beans are usually bright and uniform in color">High-quality kidney beans are usually bright and uniform in color</span>; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_288" data-source="" data-orig="for instance">for instance</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_289" data-source="" data-orig="white kidney beans should be pure white">white kidney beans should be pure white</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_290" data-source="" data-orig="and red kidney beans should be bright red">and red kidney beans should be bright red</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_291" data-source="" data-orig="Avoid choosing kidney beans that are dull in color or have spots">Avoid choosing kidney beans that are dull in color or have spots</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_292" data-source="" data-orig="The surface of kidney beans should have a certain natural luster">The surface of kidney beans should have a certain natural luster</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_293" data-source="" data-orig="indicating that they are fresh and well-preserved">indicating that they are fresh and well-preserved</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_294" data-source="" data-orig="If the surface of the kidney beans is dull">If the surface of the kidney beans is dull</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_295" data-source="" data-orig="it may indicate they have been stored for a while">it may indicate they have been stored for a while</span>.</li><li><strong>모양:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_296" data-source="" data-orig="High-quality kidney beans should be plump and rounded without obvious dents or deformities">High-quality kidney beans should be plump and rounded without obvious dents or deformities</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_297" data-source="" data-orig="Such kidney beans are more likely to maintain their integrity when cooked">Such kidney beans are more likely to maintain their integrity when cooked</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_298" data-source="" data-orig="resulting in better taste">resulting in better taste</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_299" data-source="" data-orig="Choosing evenly sized kidney beans ensures uniform cooking">Choosing evenly sized kidney beans ensures uniform cooking</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_300" data-source="" data-orig="avoiding cases where some kidney beans are overcooked while others are undercooked">avoiding cases where some kidney beans are overcooked while others are undercooked</span>.</li><li><strong>조직:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_301" data-source="" data-orig="Gently squeeze the kidney beans">Gently squeeze the kidney beans</span>; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_302" data-source="" data-orig="if they feel firm and are not easily crushed">if they feel firm and are not easily crushed</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_303" data-source="" data-orig="it indicates they are fresh and of good quality">it indicates they are fresh and of good quality</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_304" data-source="" data-orig="If the kidney beans feel soft or have a hollow sensation">If the kidney beans feel soft or have a hollow sensation</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_305" data-source="" data-orig="it may indicate they have deteriorated or been stored for too long">it may indicate they have deteriorated or been stored for too long</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_306" data-source="" data-orig="While it is not possible to directly assess the cooking taste through appearance">While it is not possible to directly assess the cooking taste through appearance</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_307" data-source="" data-orig="generally">generally</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_308" data-source="" data-orig="high-quality kidney beans will retain a certain chewiness and delicious flavor after cooking">high-quality kidney beans will retain a certain chewiness and delicious flavor after cooking</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_309" data-source="" data-orig="If the kidney beans become overly mushy or taste poor after cooking">If the kidney beans become overly mushy or taste poor after cooking</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_310" data-source="" data-orig="it may suggest poor quality or improper cooking methods">it may suggest poor quality or improper cooking methods</span>.</li></ul><p>요약, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_311" data-source="" data-orig="by carefully observing the color and shape of the kidney beans and gently squeezing them to feel their texture">by carefully observing the color and shape of the kidney beans and gently squeezing them to feel their texture</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_312" data-source="" data-orig="you can select high-quality fava beans and kidney beans">you can select high-quality fava beans and kidney beans</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_Are_the_Prices_of_Fava_Beans_and_Kidney_Beans"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_313" data-source="" data-orig="What Are the Prices of Fava Beans and Kidney Beans">What Are the Prices of Fava Beans and Kidney Beans</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_314" data-source="" data-orig="The raw material prices for fava beans and kidney beans are as follows">The raw material prices for fava beans and kidney beans are as follows</span>:</p><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_315" data-source="" data-orig="Fava Beans">Fava Beans</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_316" data-source="" data-orig="There are price differences based on different regions and markets">There are price differences based on different regions and markets</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_317" data-source="" data-orig="In Fujian and Yunnan">In Fujian and Yunnan</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_318" data-source="" data-orig="the wholesale price is about">the wholesale price is about</span> 8 킬로그램 당 위안; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_319" data-source="" data-orig="at Beijing&#8217;s Dayang Road Agricultural and Sideline Products Wholesale Market">at Beijing&#8217;s Dayang Road Agricultural and Sideline Products Wholesale Market</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_320" data-source="" data-orig="the price is about">the price is about</span> 11-12 킬로그램 당 위안; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_321" data-source="" data-orig="in Wuhan&#8217;s Baishazhou Agricultural and Sideline Products Market">in Wuhan&#8217;s Baishazhou Agricultural and Sideline Products Market</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_322" data-source="" data-orig="the price is about">the price is about</span> 10 킬로그램 당 위안.</li><li><strong>강낭콩:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_323" data-source="" data-orig="The recent price is">The recent price is</span> 15.5 킬로그램 당 위안.</li></ul><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_to_Store_Fava_Beans_and_Kidney_Beans"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_324" data-source="" data-orig="How to Store Fava Beans and Kidney Beans">How to Store Fava Beans and Kidney Beans</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_325" data-source="" data-orig="Let&#8217;s discuss how to store fava beans and kidney beans from four aspects">Let&#8217;s discuss how to store fava beans and kidney beans from four aspects</span>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_326" data-source="" data-orig="temperature">temperature</span>, 습기, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_327" data-source="" data-orig="environment">environment</span>, 그리고 포장.</p><ul><li><strong>온도:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_328" data-source="" data-orig="The storage temperature for fava beans is generally kept between 5℃ and 10℃">The storage temperature for fava beans is generally kept between 5℃ and 10℃</span>; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_329" data-source="" data-orig="for kidney beans">for kidney beans</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_330" data-source="" data-orig="the storage temperature should be between 5℃ and 8℃">the storage temperature should be between 5℃ and 8℃</span>.</li><li><strong>습기:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_331" data-source="" data-orig="The storage humidity for fava beans should be controlled between">The storage humidity for fava beans should be controlled between</span> 10% 그리고 35%, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_332" data-source="" data-orig="with an average humidity of">with an average humidity of</span> 15%-20% <span class ="tr_" id="tr_333" data-source="" data-orig="being optimal">being optimal</span>; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_334" data-source="" data-orig="the relative humidity for kidney beans should be">the relative humidity for kidney beans should be</span> 65%-75%.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_335" data-source="" data-orig="Environment">Environment</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_336" data-source="" data-orig="Both fava beans and kidney beans should be stored in a cool">Both fava beans and kidney beans should be stored in a cool</span>, 어두운, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_337" data-source="" data-orig="dry">dry</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_338" data-source="" data-orig="and well-ventilated place">and well-ventilated place</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_339" data-source="" data-orig="with effective measures to prevent moisture">with effective measures to prevent moisture</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_340" data-source="" data-orig="insects">insects</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_341" data-source="" data-orig="and rodents">and rodents</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_342" data-source="" data-orig="Fava beans should be kept out of direct sunlight to reduce oxidation and discoloration">Fava beans should be kept out of direct sunlight to reduce oxidation and discoloration</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_343" data-source="" data-orig="while kidney beans should be kept away from toxic">while kidney beans should be kept away from toxic</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_344" data-source="" data-orig="harmful">harmful</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_345" data-source="" data-orig="or damp items during storage">or damp items during storage</span>.</li><li><strong>포장:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_346" data-source="" data-orig="When storing fava beans and kidney beans">When storing fava beans and kidney beans</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_347" data-source="" data-orig="they can be packaged in plastic bags or vacuum bags to enhance sealing and prevent moisture and damage">they can be packaged in plastic bags or vacuum bags to enhance sealing and prevent moisture and damage</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_348" data-source="" data-orig="The packaging should ensure that the fava beans and kidney beans are completely dry">The packaging should ensure that the fava beans and kidney beans are completely dry</span>.</li></ul><p>또한, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_349" data-source="" data-orig="regularly check the stored fava beans and kidney beans">regularly check the stored fava beans and kidney beans</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_350" data-source="" data-orig="and promptly remove any moldy or spoiled beans to ensure effective storage">and promptly remove any moldy or spoiled beans to ensure effective storage</span>.</p>`} />
